    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Do not be late or leave early from class.</li>\n\t<li>Attendance is recorded by roll call. If you are not in your seat when your name is called, you will be marked absent.</li>\n\t<li>Do not use your cellphone during class.</li>\n\t<li>Please keep up with the course progress and speak Russian loudly.</li>\n\t<li>When reading the text, please do so in a voice loud enough for others to hear.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
